 "strings": [
  "",
  "There was a girl",
  "named Sarah Zabiarov.",
  "Living alone, she was discovered",
  "by Lieutenant Paptimus Scirocco",
  "and made an officer cadet.",
  "Keeping a teenager at his side",
  "to tend to his personal needs",
  "was an act so shameless that",
  "in another age it alone would have",
  "meant social ruin,",
  "but perhaps due to Scirocco's",
  "peculiarity, it was overlooked.",
  "She herself, though, did not",
  "believe she was simply kept",
  "as his mistress.",
  "She felt Scirocco had found",
  "her talent so that she might help",
  "carve out a new era,",
  "and she gave him her whole loyalty.",
  "As a Slavic woman, she should",
  "have gone by Zabiarova,",
  "yet she used the masculine form,",
  "Zabiarov:",
  "a sign, likely, of her zeal.",
  "It was this Sarah",
  "whom Scirocco sent to the Argama.",
  "She came feigning surrender.",
  "It was a move",
  "to counter Bask.",
  "Argama Bridge",
  "Sarah",
  "「………………」",
  "Wong",
  "\"The Titans gathered",
  " at Side 4...\"",
  "\"to stage a colony drop",
  " on the Moon, you say?\"",
  "Bright",
  "\"It's a plausible operation.\"",
  "\"Her claim that, by now,",
  " the Titans' methods...\"",
  "\"...have sickened her",
  " doesn't seem to be a lie.\"",
  "Kamille",
  "\"One of the Side 4 colonies",
  " has started moving",
  " and is picking up speed, right?\"",
  "Reccoa",
  "\"I believe",
  " the sergeant major, too.\"",
  "\"On Earth, the Federation's",
  " General Assembly is in session.\"",
  "It was clear that",
  "dropping a colony on the Moon",
  "was meant as",
  "a show of force.",
  "The loss of Granada",
  "did not mean",
  "the anti-Earth Federation movement",
  "would vanish. But",
  "the Titans' stance that, if defied,",
  "they would not shrink",
  "from a colony drop",
  "worked on Federation lawmakers",
  "as a fearsome threat.",
  "By now, two colony cylinders",
  "had fallen",
  "on Earth.",
  "There was no guarantee",
  "that the dust thrown up by a third",
  "would not bring on",
  "a nuclear winter.",
  "Carrying out",
  "a colony drop",
  "takes considerable preparation.",
  "After all, it is only because",
  "lunar and Earth gravity balance",
  "that at the Lagrange points",
  "the colonies are able",
  "to keep on turning.",
  "Moving one requires",
  "matching preparation, and",
  "the Zeon space forces of old",
  "had to commit the bulk",
  "of their strength to it",
  "in Operation British.",
  "Delaz's",
  "colony drop",
  "struck a carefully prepared",
  "colony transfer operation",
  "in mid-transit,",
  "exploiting a gap",
  "in the plan.",
  "In other words,",
  "for the Titans, a postwar force",
  "with no real combat experience,",
  "to show they now had",
  "the strength to drop a colony,",
  "an operational capability",
  "to rival the Zeon military--",
  "such a display",
  "could be said to mean a great deal.",
  "\"Please see that Granada's",
  " residents are evacuated.\"",
  "\"This whole thing is a farce.\"",
  "Wong was not fixated",
  "on the single front",
  "of the colony drop.",
  "The Titans, he thought,",
  "would likely use this as a feint",
  "and follow it with",
  "an even bigger move.",
  "But",
  "that did not mean they could",
  "leave it unanswered.",
  "If it could not protect citizens,",
  "the AEUG would lose its foundation",
  "as an army: the people's support.",
  "\"The Argama will move",
  " to stop the colony drop.\"",
  "\"Naturally.",
  " Work well with the Radish.\"",
  "\"Just what I'd expect",
  " of Wong-san, the man",
  " who bankrolls the AEUG.\"",
  "\"It seems Scirocco's",
  " Dogosse Giar isn't taking part",
  " in this operation.\"",
  "\"Why?\"",
  "\"That's not something",
  " a child like me would know.\"",
  "\"If you're a child,",
  " spying must be easy, right?\"",
  "\"A spy?",
  " Me?",
  " Hee hee hee...\"",
  "\"All hands, condition two!\"",
  "Sarah and Kamille",
  "Enter Katz Kobayashi",
  "Kamille had come",
  "to the room where Sarah",
  "was being held under house arrest.",
  "Normally,",
  "a lone visit with a prisoner,",
  "by the opposite sex at that,",
  "was out of the question;",
  "it only shows how far",
  "Kamille",
  "had earned their trust.",
  "Even the AEUG's adults",
  "placed great trust in",
  "his insight and judgment.",
  "More than his being a Newtype,",
  "it was his talent",
  "that people recognized,",
  "to put it accurately.",
  "\"A girl like you",
  " coming into the enemy's midst",
