  " who would believe me...\"",
  "\"Is that what he taught you?",
  " That saying that fools people?\"",
  "\"No, Scirocco...\"",
  "\"Paptimus Scirocco.",
  " The Jupitris man who came back",
  " from Jupiter, right?\"",
