  "had begun to carry great weight",
  "even within",
  "the AEUG's intelligence network.",
  "That he had brought his own",
  "Gundarium Gamma process",
  "to the Federation Forces,",
  "worked at Luna II on developing",
  "several transformable mobile suits,",
  "commanded the Jupiter fleet,",
  "his private army in all but name,",
  "and above all,",
  "that though a man of space",
  "he was working with",
  "the Titans:",
  "all of it merited attention.",
  "All the more reason",
  "why Sarah, Scirocco's subordinate,",
