  "\"Are you a Cyber-Newtype?\"",
  "Whether Sarah Zabiarov",
  "was a Cyber-Newtype or not,",
  "there is no firm proof.",
  "But it seems beyond doubt",
  "that Scirocco gave her drugs",
  "of some kind and practiced",
  "mind control",
  "on her.",
  "To use others as tools:",
  "not as a figure of speech,",
  "but without a pang of conscience.",
  "In being able to do just that,",
  "Paptimus Scirocco",
  "was a man apart.",
  "It was at that very moment",
