  "Scirocco,",
  "his lifelong enemy.",
  "A man who could send a young girl,",
  "a tool of his ambition, alone",
  "onto an enemy warship",
  "was not sane.",
  "That Sarah",
  "did not find this strange at all",
  "shook Kamille.",
  "Katz Kobayashi",
  "was a boy devoted to justice.",
  "To him, justice meant",
  "defeating Zeon, which had killed",
  "his birth parents, faces now dim,",
  "and so many of White Base's crew,",
  "and crushing Earth supremacism",
  "that oppressed White Base's crew.",
  "Raised amid war since childhood,",
  "he chose to fill the wounds",
  "in his heart with force of arms.",
  "That is why he volunteered",
  "for Karaba, and then the AEUG.",
  "But the first enemy the boy met,",
  "Sarah Zabiarov, was not as he'd",
  "imagined, but sweet and pure.",
  "\"Don't you",
  " have to sortie?\"",
  "Katz",
  "\"Mm... even if I wanted to,",
  " there's no mobile suit for me.\"",
  "\"There's my Hizack,",
  " isn't there?\"",
  "\"The Hizack?",
  " That's no good.\"",
  "\"My dad's museum",
  " didn't have one.\"",
  "\"I could",
  " teach you",
  " how to fly the Hizack.\"",
  "\"You could, Sarah?\"",
  "\"Pretend you're taking me away,",
  " and we can get out",
  " to the mobile suit deck.\"",
  "\"Oh, right.\"",
  "\"You're a Newtype, aren't you?",
  " I'd love to see you",
  " in action, you know?\"",
  "\"Uh... yeah. I guess so...\"",
  "\"Okay, then,",
  " helmet on, and in front of me...\"",
  "A careless move.",
  "But there was the precedent",
  "of Emma Sheen,",
  "and a lovely girl who loathed",
  "the Titans' evil and fled",
  "to their side for asylum",
  "was a story anyone, not just Katz,",
  "would want to believe.",
  "And all the more so",
  "when flattered as a Newtype:",
  "he would have been swept along.",
  "\"The transformable mobile suits",
  " the Alexandria uses",
  " have a blind spot.\"",
  "\"Huh?",
  " Even with an all-around monitor?",
  " There's a spot you can't see?\"",
  "\"Heh heh!",
  " You're sweet, aren't you...",
  " I was glad I got to meet you...\"",
  "\"Hm?\"",
  "\"Ah! Whoa!\"",
  "Seizing a momentary opening,",
  "Sarah climbed into her own Hizack",
  "and broke away.",
  "Katz fired at her back",
  "as she went,",
  "but he was never going to hit.",
  "\"I'm not being sarcastic.",
  " Katz, I really do like you...\"",
  "\"Nngh, that woman!",
  " That woman...!",
  " That woman!\"",
  "\"Damn her,",
  " she was a spy all along.",
  " I knew it!\"",
  "Fa",
  "\"Katz!",
  " What are you doing over there?",
  " It's dangerous!\"",
  "\"I didn't mean",
  " to let her get away!\"",
  "\"Huh? That girl Sarah...",
  " ...you let her escape!?\"",
  "Aboard a Titans Ship",
  "Jamaican",
  "\"The course correction",
  " can be done with",
  " two nuclear pulses, yes?\"",
  "Soldier",
  "\"Yes, sir, all on schedule.\"",
  "\"To think such a cheap trick",
  " could get the AEUG",
  " by the scruff of the neck.\"",
  "\"Even Scirocco",
  " couldn't have dreamed it up.\"",
  "\"A tactical genius indeed.",
  " Colonel Bask Om is the man",
  " who will build a new Federation.\"",
  "\"Indeed...\"",
  "Jerid",
  "\"Coming in!\"",
  "\"Did you use being stranded",
  " as cover to wreck this mission?\"",
  "\"Being back from Jupiter doesn't",
  " mean Scirocco sees the future.\"",
  "\"Who's to say?\"",
  "\"Then...",
  " did he see through it",
  " all, even me losing?\"",
  "\"Hmph!",
  " Isn't that what it means?\"",
  "Mouar",
  "\"Commander, I have a request.\"",
  "\"Would you let us",
  " take part in",
  " the colony drop operation?\"",
  "\"If you wish to atone,",
  " I'll have the staff consider it.\"",
  "\"I'll smash that Gundam!\"",
  "The Argama latched onto",
  "the falling colony",
  "only after",
  "Side 4's Bunch 27 had already",
  "entered the Moon's gravity well.",
  "The plan was to take control",
  "of the nuclear pulse engines",
  "for the final acceleration and,",
  "rather than let it fall,",
  "bring it down in a soft landing.",
  "On the low-gravity Moon,",
  "using the colony's attitude control",
  "to bring it down softly",
  "was by no means impossible.",
  "In fact,",
  "during the One Year War, several",
