  "drop on the Moon,",
  "and he was furious.",
  "To him,",
  "seizing power was the goal,",
  "and murder merely a means.",
  "But the Earth-space divide",
  "had made it impossible",
  "even to keep control of men",
  "like Bask and Jamaican.",
  "Jamitov",
  "\"That a report like this",
  " can only reach me by courier...",
  " What an age we live in!\"",
  "Aide",
  "\"Radio noise, and the advances",
  " in code-breaking technology...\"",
  "\"I know.\"",
  "\"Bask says he could not stop",
  " what his units at the bottom",
  " of the chain were doing, but...\"",
  "\"Well, that's a lie.\"",
  "\"Once they learn the Side 4",
  " colony has been moved,\"",
  "\"even the remaining 30% of votes",
  " will go to His Excellency Jamitov.\"",
  "\"I expect they will.\"",
  "\"Even I",
  " have no wish to bear the name",
  " of a mass murderer...\"",
  "\"But those militant types,",
  " even if space turns to desert,\"",
  "\"seem to think they can",
  " go right on living...\"",
  "In any case,",
  "the colony closed in on the Moon",
  "by the moment.",
  "Amid all this, Sarah Zabiarov",
  "did manage to escape",
  "from the Argama,",
  "but in the larger picture",
