  "A battle broke out",
  "over the nuclear pulse engines",
  "that would provide either",
  "the final acceleration",
  "or the orbit correction.",
  "\"Mouar.\"",
  "\"What?\"",
  "\"You don't have to",
  " push yourself on my account.\"",
  "\"What are you talking about?",
  " ...Hm?",
  " Jerid, here they come!\"",
  "\"AEUG mobile suits.",
  " Let's go!\"",
  "The nuclear pulse engines",
