  "wiped out every city",
  "on the lunar surface.",
  "Either way, this action",
  "turned Lunarian sentiment",
  "decisively toward",
  "the AEUG.",
  "The Titans,",
  "to keep their grip on the people,",
  "were now compelled to answer",
  "with still greater terror."
